  "changed_since_previous": "Added backports for #36405, #36406, #36539, #36615, and #36617, broadening the scope from only CI changes (#36701) to also include GUI PSBT versioning, Guix codesigning options, and P2P test fixes.",
  "card": "Backports six pull requests to the 32.x maintenance branch for the 32.2 release. Key changes include reverting GUI-generated PSBTs back to version 0 to resolve compatibility issues for GUI users, adjusting Guix codesign archive ownership options, disabling ARM32 CI tests, and resolving false-pass bugs and flakes in P2P functional tests. All backported commits are already merged into master.",
